    "text": "501lifemag.com\nwebsite\nHot Springs\n06 Aug 2025 501 Hometown Hall of Famers: Eric Jackson\nBy Levi GIlbert,\n1 hours agoMeet the man who has guided Oaklawn Park race track in Hot Springs in adapting with new products and services for almost four decades, helping the facility become one of the premier horse racing venues of the 21st century. Jackson was inducted into the Arkansas Sports Hall of Fame (ASHOF)...",
